{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > From the makers of <i>The Tomorrow Children</i>, <i>PixelJunk Monsters</i>, <i>PixelJunk Eden</i>, <i>PixelJunk Shooter</i> and <i>Nom Nom Galaxy</i> comes a beautiful new game utilizing point cloud rendering technology.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3561230/extras/1344eef3e906228788735e742356a17d.poster.avif?t=1760052324\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3561230/extras/1344eef3e906228788735e742356a17d.webm?t=1760052324\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Dreams of Another</i> is a third-person exploration-action game built around the theme, &quot;<i>No Creation Without Destruction</i>&quot;, which turns typical third-person shooter gameplay on its head. In <i>Dreams of Another</i>, the more you destroy, the more you create! The world forms around you, the player, as you explore this ephemeral dream-like world, born from the mind of <i>PixelJunk Eden</i>'s director and multimedia artist <i>Baiyon</i>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3561230/extras/cdf4db827191c4e80c38f4937fe3c7ca.poster.avif?t=1760052324\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3561230/extras/cdf4db827191c4e80c38f4937fe3c7ca.webm?t=1760052324\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Follow the <i>Man in Pajamas</i> and the <i>Wandering Soldier</i> to unlock and explore their imagination, past memories and life experiences. Piece together the interwoven stories in this unconventional game that challenges common tropes and invites players to understand not just the game, but their own life in a whole new light.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3561230/extras/9f213a84ef273c398b785c5e80852342.poster.avif?t=1760052324\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3561230/extras/9f213a84ef273c398b785c5e80852342.webm?t=1760052324\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Key Features</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >-Innovative gameplay where shooting doesn't destroy but creates.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >-A dream world rendered through unique point cloud technology.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >-A poetic story centering on &quot;The Man in Pajamas &quot; and &quot;The Wandering Soldier,&quot; featuring conversations with peculiar characters and objects.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >-Humorous lines spoken by various sentient objects offer an offbeat, amusing, yet thought-provoking perspective on human society, the nature of the world and more.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >-A unique, experimental soundtrack crafted by director Baiyon himself.</p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"The Wandering Soldier's Past","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3561230/bd8ed7a0404a5ddc4a365749ea0dd4fab75e5769.jpg"},{"name":"The Dreams of the Man in Pajamas","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3561230/9ffb5437b73dfb959df7c5d5cfaab6a50fa801a9.jpg"},{"name":"The Boy's Wish","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3561230/19eb2c2953b35bdd5d86af0b0f8bbb59d5b43f70.jpg"},{"name":"The Future of the Rides","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3561230/fb5c13c9504a7835785c2ae41e4821f3f9fcf011.jpg"},{"name":"The Whereabouts of the Three Fish","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3561230/a58e10297f07820b0187165bdf91ed0ae7c1ff42.jpg"},{"name":"The Art Pieces Left Behind","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3561230/a1b0e5a241642952cdef4488b90057d0d9c5e20d.jpg"},{"name":"Dreams of Another","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3561230/3fa489de557bfe19cb32062e43c0c8b946b72598.jpg"},{"name":"The Wandering Soldier: Memory #1 \"The Cat at the Riverbank\"","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3561230/aeb9d66ecd62c29f7038522a37e6077e93d75008.jpg"},{"name":"The Wandering Soldier: Memory #2 \"How to Know if One Love Someone\"","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3561230/47dec4fed62cc606e5c94417fe194ed58d24340f.jpg"},{"name":"The Man in Pajamas: Memory #1 \"What is a Beautiful Flower?\"","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3561230/7bb927966af07a38b14425a72efa42e271c9d036.jpg"}],"total":49},"background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3561230?t=1760052324","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3561230/66348512ff35e71b2872d42c3331286944f9b368/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1760052324","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3561230/05d35a3b701a070eb73ef6d2a80b476de6b3c80c/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1760052324","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3561230/05d35a3b701a070eb73ef6d2a80b476de6b3c80c/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1760052324","categories":[{"descript